        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jeshua wakaambila bana ba-Israyeli kuti, Ino mulasowa ciindi cili buti kukunelela kwanu? Mulaya lili kukuvuba nyika Jehova Leza wamausowanu njaamupa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulisalile bantu botatwe botatwe kumisyobo yanu, nkabatume kuya bweendeenda munyika yoonse, bailembe nyika yakuvuba mbwiibede, akuboola alimwi kulindime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
