        {
          "text": "Lino kuzwa kucilundu cili kubbazu lyakumusanza lya-Beti-horoni, mugaano wakumbo wakanyona kumusanza akugola ku-Kiriyati-baala, ngonguwo Kiriyati-Jearimu, munzi wabana ba-Juda. Mbuubede mugaano wakumbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.14"
            ]
