            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amugaano wakumusanza wakazwa kumamanino aa-Kiriyati-Jearimu, akuzwa kumbo wakainda kukasensa kamaanzi ka-Nefiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
