        {
          "text": "Oko wakanyona kuya kunyika akwiinda ku-Eni-semesi, alimwi wakainda ku-Gelilotu, uulangene amantantilo aa-Adumi, akusika kundomba lya-Bohani mwana wa-Rubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
