              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi mugaano wakainda kubbazu lyakunyika lyakalundu ka-Beti-hogila, amagolelo aawo akali kumusundila wakunyika wa-Lwizi lwamunyo, nkokuti kumamanino aakumusanza wa-Jordano, Mbuboobo mbuubede mugaano wakumusanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
